cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the accompanying manuscript."
title: "maxtoki-mechinterp: method specifications, agent records and corrected analyses for agent-run interpretability of MaxToki-217M"
abstract: >
  Method specifications for interpretability analyses of single-cell
  foundation models, written for coding agents. The repository also holds
  the code, logs and outputs of an agent-run deployment of these
  specifications on MaxToki-217M; an error ledger of that deployment; the
  protocol, agent deliverables, reviews and grades of three controlled
  studies of the specifications and of a ten-item audit checklist; the
  corrected MaxToki-217M analyses; and a results map that links every
  number in the manuscript to its source file. Files too large for the
  repository are listed with checksums in ZENODO_MANIFEST.csv.
authors:
